            "渗透压"@zh ;
        dcterms:description """The "Osmotic Pressure" is the pressure which needs to be applied to a solution to prevent the inward flow
    of water across a semipermeable membrane.
  """^^qudt:LatexString ;
        qudt:applicableUnit unit:ATM,
