        qudt:isoNormativeReference "http://www.iso.org/iso/catalogue_detail?csnumber=31895"^^xsd:anyURI ;
        qudt:latexDefinition "$q = -\\frac{dn}{dt}$, where $n$ is the number density and $dt$ is the duration."^^qudt:LatexString ;
        qudt:plainTextDescription """"Slowing-Down Density" is a measure of the rate at which neutrons lose energy in a nuclear reactor
    through collisions; equal to the number of neutrons that fall below a given energy per unit volume per unit time.
