        qudt:normativeReference "http://www.iso.org/iso/catalogue_detail?csnumber=31895"^^xsd:anyURI ;
        qudt:plainTextDescription """"Total Cross-section" is related to the absorbance of the light intensity through Beer-Lambert's
    law. It is the sum of all cross-sections corresponding to the various reactions or processes between an incident particle of
