            "音源の音響出力"@ja,
            "moc akustyczna"@pl,
            "potência acústica"@pt,
            "звуковая мощность"@ru ;
        dcterms:description """Sound power or acoustic power $P_a$ is a measure of sonic energy $E$ per time $t$ unit. It is measured in
    watts and can be computed as sound intensity ($I$) times area ($A$).
  """^^qudt:LatexString ;
        qudt:applicableUnit unit:BAR-L-PER-SEC,
