        dcterms:description """Becquerel Per Cubic Meter ($Bq/m3$) is a unit in the category of Radioactivity concentration. It is also
    known as becquerels per cubic meter, becquerel per cubic metre, becquerels per cubic metre, becquerel/cubic inch. This unit is
