            "Millikatal per Liter"@en-us ;
        dcterms:description """A unit of catalytic activity used especially in the chemistry of enzymes. A catalyst is a substance that
    starts or speeds a chemical reaction. Enzymes are proteins that act as catalysts within the bodies of living plants and
