        qudt:latexDefinition "$AH = \\frac{\\mathcal{M}_\\omega}{\\vee_{net}}$, where $\\mathcal{M}_\\omega$ is the mass of water vapour per unit volume of total air and $\\vee_{net}$ is water vapour mixture."^^qudt:LatexString ;
