    medical condition (typically a disease or a risk factor such as smoking or seatbelt use) at a specific time. (Wikipedia)
  """^^xsd:string ;
        qudt:qkdvDenominator qkdv:A0E0L0I0M0H0T0D1 ;
        qudt:qkdvNumerator qkdv:A0E0L0I0M0H0T0D1 ;
        qudt:wikidataMatch <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q719602> ;
