        dcterms:description """Square Meter Per Mole (m2/mol) is a unit in the category of Specific Area. It is also known as square
    meters per mole, square metre per per, square metres per per, square meter/per, square metre/per. This unit is commonly used
    in the SI unit system. Square Meter Per Mole (m2/mol) has a dimension of M-1L2 where $M$ is mass, and $L$ is length. This unit
    is the standard SI unit in this category.
  """^^rdf:HTML ;
        qudt:applicableSystem sou:SI ;
        qudt:conversionMultiplier 1.0 ;
