        rdfs:label "Atmospheric Hydroxylation Rate"@en ;
        dcterms:description """A second order reaction rate constant that is a specific second order reaction rate constant that governs
    the kinetics of an atmospheric, gas-phase reaction between hydroxyl radicals and an organic chemical.
  """^^qudt:LatexString ;
