            "Watt na Čtvereční Metr Kelvin"@cs,
            "Watt pro Quadratmeter Kelvin"@de,
            "Βατ ανά Τετραγωνικό Μέτρο Κέλβιν"@el,
            "Watt per Square Metre Kelvin"@en,
            "Watt per Square Meter Kelvin"@en-us,
            "Vatio por Metro Cuadrado Kelvin"@es,
            "Watt par Mètre Carré Kelvin"@fr,
            "Watt per Metro Quadrato Kelvin"@it,
            "Wattium per Metrum Quadratum Kelvin"@la,
            "Watt per Meter Persegi Kelvin"@ms,
            "Wat na Metr Kwadratowy Kelwin"@pl,
            "Watt por Metro Quadrado Kelvin"@pt,
            "Watt pe Metru Pătrat Kelvin"@ro,
            "Ватт на Квадратный Метр Кельвин"@ru,
            "Watt na Kvadratni Meter Kelvin"@sl,
            "Watt per Metrekare Kelvin"@tr ;
        dcterms:description """The unit $\\textit{Watt Per Square Meter Kelvin }$ ($W m^{-2} K^{-1}$) is a unit in the category of
    Thermal heat transfer coefficient. It is also known as $\\textit{watt/square meter-kelvin}$. This unit is commonly used in the
    SI unit system. $\\textit{Watt Per Square Meter Kelvin }$ has a dimension of $MT^{-1}Q^{-1}$ where $M$ is mass, $T$ is time,
    and $Q$ is temperature. This unit is the standard SI unit in this category.
  """^^qudt:LatexString ;
        qudt:applicableSystem sou:SI ;
        qudt:conversionMultiplier 1.0 ;
        qudt:conversionMultiplierSN 1e+00 ;
        qudt:definedUnitOfSystem sou:SI ;
        qudt:derivedCoherentUnitOfSystem sou:SI ;
        qudt:expression "$W/(m^{2}-K)$"^^qudt:LatexString ;
        qudt:hasDimensionVector qkdv:A0E0L0I0M1H-1T-3D0 ;
        qudt:hasFactorUnit _:ne65d4cbea54444c6960902e3884365fdb4967,
            _:ne65d4cbea54444c6960902e3884365fdb4968,
            _:ne65d4cbea54444c6960902e3884365fdb4969 ;
        qudt:hasQuantityKind quantitykind:CoefficientOfHeatTransfer,
            quantitykind:CombinedNonEvaporativeHeatTransferCoefficient ;
        qudt:hasReciprocalUnit unit:M2-K-PER-W ;
        qudt:iec61360Code "0112/2///62720#UAA311"^^xsd:string ;
        qudt:informativeReference "https://cdd.iec.ch/cdd/iec62720/iec62720.nsf/Units/0112-2---62720%23UAA311"^^xsd:anyURI ;
        qudt:symbol "W/(m²·K)"^^xsd:string ;
        qudt:ucumCode "W.m-2.K-1"^^qudt:UCUMcs ;
        qudt:uneceCommonCode "D55"^^xsd:string ;
        qudt:unitForQuantityKind quantitykind:CoefficientOfHeatTransfer,
            quantitykind:CombinedNonEvaporativeHeatTransferCoefficient ;
        qudt:wikidataMatch <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q3566738> ;
        rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://qudt.org/3.4.0/vocab/unit> .

