        dcterms:description """Pounds or Pounds Force per Square Foot is a British (Imperial) and American pressure unit which is
    directly related to the psi pressure unit by a factor of 144 (1 sq ft = 12 in x 12 in = 144 sq in). 1 Pound per Square Foot
