        qudt:latexDefinition "$\\tau_{xz} = \\eta\\frac{dv_x}{dz}$, where $\\tau_{xz}$ is shear stress in a fluid moving with a velocity gradient $\\frac{dv_x}{dz}$ perpendicular to the plane of shear. "^^qudt:LatexString ;
