        rdfs:label "Linear Velocity"@en ;
        dcterms:description """Linear Velocity, as the name implies deals with speed in a straight line, the units are often $km/hr$ or
    $m/s$ or $mph$ (miles per hour). Linear Velocity (v) = change in distance/change in time, where $v = \\bigtriangleup
    d/\\bigtriangleup t$
